  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development, as a result of its position, scale and design would be an incongruous and uncharacteristic addition to the detriment of the character and appearance of the area.  It would also detract from the outlook of the neighbours at no.11 Hereford Road, appearing as an unduly overbearing and visually intrusive feature to the detriment of the living conditions of the occupiers of that property.  The proposal does not therefore comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) together with the aims and objectives of the Character Sustainability and Design Codes SPD"
